Subject: [PATCH 1231/1695] dts: stm32: allocate RNG2 to secure for
 stm32mp215f-dk

RNG2 is default enable in OP-TEE to seed the software RNG.
Can't use RNG1 as it's only available on c/f SoC.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git c0c206e93f0d94bba17cf404a907e8dafb16e80d dts: stm32: allocate RNG2 to secure for stm32mp215f-dk]
