Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/405063
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp215f-dk-ca35tdcid-rif.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp215f-dk-ca35tdcid-rif.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp215f-dk-ca35tdcid-rif.dtsi
